00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:51,960
And under that transcoding task, there will be many sub-tasks for transcoding.

238
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:53,480
So, why are there so many transcoding subtasks?

239
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:55,610
So, you can think of a transcoding sub-task as, for example,

240
00:08:55,610 --> 00:08:59,570
For example, let's say I want to convert it to both 4K and 1080P.

