00:08:59,570 --> 00:09:00,980
So that's two transcoding tasks right there.

242
00:09:00,980 --> 00:09:05,260
So, in other words, each resolution corresponds to a single transcoding sub-task.

243
00:09:05,260 --> 00:09:07,380
So, for the transcoding, we're talking about this main task and its subtasks.

244
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:09,160
So, it's a one-to-many relationship.

245
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:12,990
And then, moving on, we have the video's metadata information.

246
00:09:12,990 --> 00:09:15,270
This includes things like its thumbnails,

247
00:09:15,270 --> 00:09:15,810
things like the title and description.

248
00:09:15,810 --> 00:09:16,670
Right.

249
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:19,150
